> 1. What types of food do different types of pets like for treats?
If you want to tame a carnivore (dog/cat), best use a tripe ration or
some light corpse.  Unfortunately the latter would rot away when you
carry it.  If you want to tame a horse use some fruit (not the slime
mold, but apple, banana etc.) or a lichen corpse.
Human food (foo-rations, cookies etc.) can also be used, but only for
angry monsters, and it would sometimes make them peaceful instead of taming.

